{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02048",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.64,
      "end_seconds": 8.94,
      "duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "Oh, hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.69,
      "end_seconds": 15.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 16.54,
      "end_seconds": 20.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.08,
      "end_seconds": 23.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Absolutely, come and sit beside them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.93,
      "end_seconds": 35.1,
      "duration_seconds": 9.17,
      "text": "Honestly, you know, it's sudden confusion over a day, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.83,
      "end_seconds": 44.36,
      "duration_seconds": 8.53,
      "text": "Alright, can you tell me when it first started? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.33,
      "end_seconds": 49.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Since last night, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.36,
      "end_seconds": 54.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Okay, is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.32,
      "end_seconds": 82.56,
      "duration_seconds": 26.24,
      "text": "Actually, when it starts I tend to get a fever as well. I mean, uh, the fever? That's been since Friday. About fever, it just comes and goes. And seeing things that aren't there, too. Let me think, I've also had not knowing where she is, for one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.81,
      "end_seconds": 87.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "And what about weakness on one side or fall?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.27,
      "end_seconds": 90.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "none of those, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.56,
      "end_seconds": 96.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "a few quick ones: chest pain or head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.31,
      "end_seconds": 100.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.62,
      "end_seconds": 104.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.68,
      "end_seconds": 108.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.63,
      "end_seconds": 113.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.67,
      "end_seconds": 117.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Mm, no, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.06,
      "end_seconds": 125.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.63,
      "end_seconds": 131.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Losartan, 50 milligrams, maybe, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.57,
      "end_seconds": 136.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "did you happen to bring the box or the paperwork?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.98,
      "end_seconds": 147.8,
      "duration_seconds": 9.82,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. I take escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 149.24,
      "end_seconds": 160.19,
      "duration_seconds": 10.95,
      "text": "So, doctor, I think the last prescription for the escitalopram was 20 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.76,
      "end_seconds": 165.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I see. Is the most recent prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.41,
      "end_seconds": 170.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "No, I left it at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.45,
      "end_seconds": 174.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Okay, before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.36,
      "end_seconds": 183.62,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "years back I got vomiting from tramadol, so I stay away from it now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.14,
      "end_seconds": 206.93,
      "duration_seconds": 8.79,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.91,
      "end_seconds": 211.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for two years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.51,
      "end_seconds": 214.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Is there anything more?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.41,
      "end_seconds": 217.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "I've got depression"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.31,
      "end_seconds": 228.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.33,
      "text": "Right, right. Okay, I can see high blood pressure and and depression in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.86,
      "end_seconds": 238.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.88,
      "end_seconds": 245.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Yes, I had my tonsils removed, as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.15,
      "end_seconds": 251.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.72,
      "end_seconds": 256.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.36,
      "end_seconds": 259.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.34,
      "end_seconds": 266.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.29,
      "end_seconds": 272.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.92,
      "end_seconds": 277.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.91,
      "end_seconds": 281.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.05,
      "end_seconds": 286.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.17,
      "end_seconds": 290.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.2,
      "end_seconds": 303.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "sit still for a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.36,
      "end_seconds": 324.51,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 96 percent, temperature 38.1. And BP is 116 over 73, pulse 104."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.95,
      "end_seconds": 331.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Alright, I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.46,
      "end_seconds": 334.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.82,
      "end_seconds": 358.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "She is drowsy, hot, disoriented, and her blood pressure is low."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.44,
      "end_seconds": 379.38,
      "duration_seconds": 15.94,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. Right, here's what I'm thinking. The most likely explanation is delirium from an infection. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. A stroke is still possible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 395.0,
      "end_seconds": 415.46,
      "duration_seconds": 20.46,
      "text": "Let's book blood tests to look into delirium. Let's book a chest X-ray to look into fever and confusion. She needs to go to hospital today for fluids and antibiotics. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 417.47,
      "end_seconds": 419.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "I, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 420.12,
      "end_seconds": 423.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "I'd like you back straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 428.29,
      "end_seconds": 431.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "I'll note it in my calendar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 435.63,
      "end_seconds": 439.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 439.83,
      "end_seconds": 442.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}